# Raw and derived market data never enter the repo. CBOE's terms allow
# personal, non-commercial use only, so the CSVs stay outside the repo in
# $VOL_DATA_DIR (default ~/data/vol-projects). These patterns catch copies
# that land here by mistake.
# Anchored with a leading slash: an unanchored `data/` would also ignore
# app/src/data/ and app/public/data/synthetic/, the committed fixtures.
/data/
app/public/data/real/
# Only the synthetic fixture folder under app/public/data/ is committed; any other
# JSON there (or a *.real.json anywhere) is a real-data export in the wrong place.
app/public/data/*
!app/public/data/synthetic/
*.real.json
*.csv.gz
*.parquet
!tests/fixtures/**/*.parquet

# Every CSV is ignored, wherever it lands and in any letter case (git has no
# case-insensitive switch per pattern, hence the classes): a VIX_History.csv or
# VIX_HISTORY.CSV saved by a notebook or dropped at the repo root is exactly the
# leak the licence rules out.
# Two exceptions, and only two (lower-case .csv only):
#   * tests/fixtures/: small hand-made test inputs.
#   * reports/*.agg.csv: committed aggregate tables, top level only (no regime
#     sub-folders: D2 keeps regime cells local). They MUST end in
#     .agg.csv, and ADR 0001 D2 governs what may go in them (only the
#     publication set P: unitless, rounded numbers; one release per data_end).
*.[cC][sS][vV]
!tests/fixtures/**/*.csv
!reports/*.agg.csv

# Other data and cache formats a download or a notebook can leave behind
*.tsv
*.zip
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.feather
*.arrow
*.npy
*.npz
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.db
*.duckdb
# yfinance and requests caches
.cache/
py-yfinance/

# JSON where a notebook or a quick export would drop vendor data (FRED's API
# returns JSON). notebooks/ holds only .ipynb files and app/src/data/ only the
# *.synthetic.json fixtures. A notebook saved WITH outputs needs no pattern:
# tools/build_notebooks.py --check (pytest runs it) fails on a notebook that is
# not exactly its spec, saved outputs included, and on any extra .ipynb.
notebooks/**/*.json
app/src/data/*.json
!app/src/data/*.synthetic.json

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/

